ço, tranquilidade e a exclusividade de viver no Batel.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d6ab2436-4e49-4cd6-8187-937454625491.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f67d6261-7441-4bbd-b33c-15381a71308a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d2ef899-0435-4d5d-831b-d44278e37d03.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2eec39a5-5c9d-47be-b512-7da710aed51c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f5746bcc-f451-4ab6-a499-361a7b43dd3b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6a77d1dc-fd05-45b8-8853-161341145a1c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/be5a10bb-ac6b-4685-b939-879d241c4763.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9b1acc7c-0a87-418f-aadd-49fb565bbf4e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0dd78a9a-0f2c-44a5-b8f9-2e3d2cdbda25.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/26d182f2-565a-4c58-9f06-390ba9ca2ced.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/452e78ce-18ff-46d1-9173-93a456635c45.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5708a1e0-8d74-423d-88fa-d3f387511196.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a90eb40ac22bce2c3712461/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b87c40ed-bc92-4747-b6aa-4f66e9c50e8e.jpeg